*   **None.** BAC has remained structurally broken, pinned below both its 50 SMA ($51.03) and 200 SMA ($50.75). The financial sector's persistent weakness and the lack of a trend-reversal signal (like reclaiming the 50 SMA on volume) made any rebuy attempt high-risk and low-probability.

