### Rebuy Opportunities
*   **None.** XLE never retreated significantly. The stock hit new 52-week highs repeatedly during the trade's remaining life, confirming that technical "overbought" signals (RSI > 70) in high-conviction geopolitical regimes are not reliable reversal markers.

