*   **The Overbought Trap:** Entry was based on RSI (73.7) and Bollinger Band extremes. However, the stock continued to trade *along* the upper band, hitting an RSI of 83.7 by late March. Overbought signals in divergent sectors (XLE green while SPY is deep red) are often signals of *strength*, not exhaustion.
